 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2347) 'answers the sign of the 10-px steps to that point. A held move stops
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2347) 'at the target. An answer older than 15 frames hands the paddle to the
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2347) 'teacher. With the classic angle rule on both paddles, the model wins
 # tags: rfd:decision
