 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2347) 'a 4-frame reply, against a 14-px reach. One failed request froze the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2347) 'paddle on "stay" for the rest of a run. The drawn paddles were twice
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2347) 'the size of the colliding ones, and the right one sat 10 px behind its
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2347) 'hit plane. The overlap test had a wrong y term, the timecode printed
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2347) 'hundredths, serves were seeded from the clock, and 600 frames sat in
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2347  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2347) 'memory. The README contradicted the files on disk.
